*_intervjuunderlag_*.md
*_interview_brief_*.md

# Erik Engberg's hand-built Utbildningsgrupp -> SUN 2020 crosswalk.
# His unpublished work for the ESO project, not SCB's and not ours to
# publish. It was moved to the private Magnus-L/data-notes mirror on
# 2 Sep 2026 and a copy was re-committed here on 4 Sep. This repo is
# PUBLIC and the paper's data-availability statement points at it.
# The file stays on disk for the MONA upload; it must not be tracked.
revision/upload/utb_grupp2_sun2020_niva3_inr4_nyckel.dta
paper/appendix_offline_v1.tex
appendix_offline*

# Replication package: what a run writes is not tracked; the exported MONA
# aggregates, their logs included, are the record and are tracked.
replication/output/
replication/data/processed/
replication/data/raw/platsbanken/
replication/data/raw/*.jsonl.zip
replication/3_register_mona/master_logs/
!replication/3_register_mona/exports/**

# Yahoo Finance series: not redistributed (terms); fetched by src/03 and replication/1_data_public/03
data/raw/omxs30_daily.csv
data/raw/omxspi_daily.csv

# Autor-Dorn source files and the SSYK file derived from them: no licence
# stated on ddorn.net, so kept local until redistribution is cleared
# (revision/local/l54_rti_ssyk4.py rebuilds both from the public URLs)
data/raw/autor_dorn/
revision/upload/rti_ssyk4.dta

# Internal MONA trip sheets (operational notes, not part of the replication record)
revision/mona/TRIP_*.md
